	fi
fi
sound 52A.aac
text @[Koumura]
text Hmm... I think it was...
sound 52B.aac
text @[Koumura]
text ...Fuko.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text With that said, he finally walks away.
text Ahh...
text How could I have forgotten even that...
text So much for all the resolve I'd had to not forget her.
text Anyway, the memory is returning to me...
text ...There was a small party hat.
text And right next to me...
text @[Tomoya]
text Fuko...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGFU30B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGFU30B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Fuko]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text So... you've always been by my side...
sound 52C.aac
text @[Fuko]
text ...Yes. Always.
text @[Tomoya]
text I really am the worst, ain't I?
text @[Tomoya]
text To have forgotten about someone so close to me...
sound 52D.aac
text @[Fuko]
text No, you are not the worst.
sound 52E.aac
text @[Fuko]
text ...It's just a natural thing to do.
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't say...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...such a sad thing.
text @[Tomoya]
text I want to... be with you, always...
sound 52F.aac
text @[Fuko]
text ...Thank you very much.
text @[Tomoya]
text So don't connect just my hand and {$lnmA}'s...
text @[Tomoya]
text Put your hand in ours, too...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGFU24B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGFU24B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Fuko]
text ...
sound 52G.aac
text @[Fuko]
text Then, please... hold out your hand.
text She takes my hand into hers and grasps strongly.
sound 52H.aac
text @[Fuko]
text Fuko... won't let go of your hand.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes, neither will I...
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
