text There's no starfish standing in our way anymore. Fuko is leaning against me.
text Everything has come to an end.
text The days when she had to work so hard with her small body.
text She really, really tried so hard.
text All that's left is the waiting.
text The same as we've been doing for forever: waiting for Kouko-san's wedding ceremony.
